{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a3c8e56f-1b2d-4e7a-9c1f-7b3d0e5a6c81",
    "name": "PhonePe PG V2 TPV Standard Checkout",
    "description": "PhonePe Payment Gateway V2 - TPV (Third-Party Validation) Standard Checkout.\n\nIntroduction: TPV lets BFSI merchants accept payments only from pre-registered / validated customer bank accounts. It is the Standard Checkout hosted PayPage flow, plus a constraints[] array that restricts payment to the listed bank account(s). Works on web (redirect PayPage) and mobile (SDK order token).\n\nFolders:\n- Authorization -> Get Access Token\n- Payment -> Website Checkout, Mobile Checkout (SDK Order)\n- Status -> Check Order Status\n- Refund -> Initiate Refund, Check Refund Status\n- Webhooks (Mock Server)\n\nCredentials: set client_id, client_version, client_secret and tsp_env in the environment; the access token is fetched/refreshed automatically. Set tpv_ifsc + tpv_account_number to the allowed bank account.\n\nEnvironments:\n- Sandbox: https://api-preprod.phonepe.com/apis/pg-sandbox/<Endpoint>\n- Production: Authorization API https://api.phonepe.com/apis/identity-manager/<Endpoint> ; Other APIs https://api.phonepe.com/apis/pg/<Endpoint>\n\nAPI Endpoints:\n- Authorization          POST /v1/oauth/token\n- Website Checkout       POST /checkout/v2/pay\n- Mobile Checkout        POST /checkout/v2/sdk/order\n- Check Order Status     GET  /checkout/v2/order/{merchantOrderId}/status\n- Initiate Refund        POST /payments/v2/refund\n\nDocs: https://developer.phonepe.com/tpv-standard-checkout",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "const env = pm.environment.get('tsp_env') || 'sandbox';",
          "const isProd = env === 'production';",
          "const authUrl = isProd",
          "  ? 'https://api.phonepe.com/apis/identity-manager/v1/oauth/token'",
          "  : 'https://api-preprod.phonepe.com/apis/pg-sandbox/v1/oauth/token';",
          "const apiBase = isProd",
          "  ? 'https://api.phonepe.com/apis/pg'",
          "  : 'https://api-preprod.phonepe.com/apis/pg-sandbox';",
          "pm.environment.set('auth_url', authUrl);",
          "pm.environment.set('api_base_url', apiBase);",
          "",
          "const location = pm.execution.location || [];",
          "if (location.includes('Authorization') || location.includes('Webhooks (Mock Server)')) {",
          "  return;",
          "}",
          "",
          "const token = pm.environment.get('access_token') || '';",
          "if (!token) {",
          "  throw new Error('Missing access_token. Run Authorization/Get Access Token first.');",
          "}",
          "pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'Authorization', value: `O-Bearer ${token}` });"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Authorization",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Access Token",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                { "key": "client_id", "value": "{{client_id}}", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "client_version", "value": "{{client_version}}", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "client_secret", "value": "{{client_secret}}", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "grant_type", "value": "client_credentials", "type": "text" }
              ]
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{auth_url}}", "host": ["{{auth_url}}"] },
            "description": "Generate the O-Bearer access token required to authenticate all TPV Standard Checkout requests."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Auth success', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200, 201]); });",
                  "const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.environment.set('access_token', data.access_token || '');",
                  "pm.environment.set('token_type', data.token_type || 'O-Bearer');",
                  "pm.environment.set('token_expires_at', String(data.expires_at || 0));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Payment",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Website Checkout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [ { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" } ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"merchantOrderId\": \"{{merchant_order_id}}\", // auto-generated each run (ORDER_<timestamp>)\n  \"amount\": {{checkout_amount}}, // enter your amount here in paisa (min 100; 10000 = Rs.100)\n  \"expireAfter\": {{expire_after}}, // enter payment validity here in seconds (300-3600)\n  \"metaInfo\": {\n    \"udf1\": \"udf1\" // optional passthrough fields udf1-udf5\n  },\n  \"paymentFlow\": {\n    \"type\": \"PG_CHECKOUT\",\n    \"message\": \"Payment message shown for collect requests\", // optional message shown to the customer\n    \"merchantUrls\": {\n      \"redirectUrl\": \"{{redirect_url}}\", // enter the post-payment return URL here\n      \"cancelRedirectUrl\": \"{{cancel_redirect_url}}\" // enter the URL to return to if the customer cancels\n    }\n  },\n  \"constraints\": [\n    {\n      \"type\": \"ACCOUNT\",\n      \"ifsc\": \"{{tpv_ifsc}}\", // enter the allowed bank IFSC here (payment restricted to this account)\n      \"accountNumber\": \"{{tpv_account_number}}\" // enter the allowed bank account number here\n    }\n  ]\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{api_base_url}}/checkout/v2/pay",
              "host": ["{{api_base_url}}"],
              "path": ["checkout", "v2", "pay"]
            },
            "description": "Create a TPV Standard Checkout order for web. Returns orderId + redirectUrl (hosted PayPage). Payment is restricted to the account(s) listed in constraints[]. https://developer.phonepe.com/tpv-standard-checkout"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.environment.set('merchant_order_id', 'ORDER_' + Date.now());",
                  "if (!pm.environment.get('checkout_amount')) { pm.environment.set('checkout_amount', '10000'); }",
                  "if (!pm.environment.get('expire_after')) { pm.environment.set('expire_after', '1200'); }",
                  "if (!pm.environment.get('redirect_url')) { pm.environment.set('redirect_url', 'https://www.google.com'); }",
                  "if (!pm.environment.get('cancel_redirect_url')) { pm.environment.set('cancel_redirect_url', 'https://www.google.com'); }"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Order created', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200, 201]); });",
                  "const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (data && data.orderId) { pm.environment.set('order_id', data.orderId); }",
                  "if (data && data.redirectUrl) { pm.environment.set('checkout_redirect_url', data.redirectUrl); }"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Mobile Checkout (SDK Order)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [ { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" } ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"merchantOrderId\": \"{{merchant_order_id}}\", // auto-generated each run (ORDER_<timestamp>)\n  \"amount\": {{checkout_amount}}, // enter your amount here in paisa (min 100)\n  \"expireAfter\": {{expire_after}}, // enter validity here in seconds (300-3600)\n  \"metaInfo\": {\n    \"udf1\": \"udf1\" // optional passthrough fields udf1-udf5\n  },\n  \"paymentFlow\": {\n    \"type\": \"PG_CHECKOUT\"\n  },\n  \"constraints\": [\n    {\n      \"type\": \"ACCOUNT\",\n      \"ifsc\": \"{{tpv_ifsc}}\", // enter the allowed bank IFSC here\n      \"accountNumber\": \"{{tpv_account_number}}\" // enter the allowed bank account number here\n    }\n  ]\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{api_base_url}}/checkout/v2/sdk/order",
              "host": ["{{api_base_url}}"],
              "path": ["checkout", "v2", "sdk", "order"]
            },
            "description": "Create a TPV order token for the mobile SDK. Returns orderId + token (pass the token to the PhonePe mobile SDK). https://developer.phonepe.com/tpv-standard-checkout"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.environment.set('merchant_order_id', 'ORDER_' + Date.now());",
                  "if (!pm.environment.get('checkout_amount')) { pm.environment.set('checkout_amount', '10000'); }",
                  "if (!pm.environment.get('expire_after')) { pm.environment.set('expire_after', '1200'); }"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('SDK order created', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200, 201]); });",
                  "const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (data && data.orderId) { pm.environment.set('order_id', data.orderId); }",
                  "if (data && data.token) { pm.environment.set('order_token', data.token); }"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Status",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Check Order Status",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [ { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" } ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{api_base_url}}/checkout/v2/order/{{merchant_order_id}}/status?details=true",
              "host": ["{{api_base_url}}"],
              "path": ["checkout", "v2", "order", "{{merchant_order_id}}", "status"],
              "query": [ { "key": "details", "value": "true" } ]
            },
            "description": "Fetch the order status by merchantOrderId. Poll until state is COMPLETED / FAILED. https://developer.phonepe.com/tpv-standard-checkout"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Refund",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Initiate Refund",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [ { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" } ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"merchantRefundId\": \"{{merchant_refund_id}}\", // auto-generated each run by pre-request script (REFUND_<timestamp>)\n  \"originalMerchantOrderId\": \"{{merchant_order_id}}\", // enter the original order id to refund here\n  \"amount\": {{refund_amount}} // enter refund amount here in paisa (min 100, must be <= captured amount)\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{api_base_url}}/payments/v2/refund",
              "host": ["{{api_base_url}}"],
              "path": ["payments", "v2", "refund"]
            },
            "description": "Refund a COMPLETED TPV payment (full or partial)."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.environment.set('merchant_refund_id', 'REFUND_' + Date.now());",
                  "if (!pm.environment.get('refund_amount')) { pm.environment.set('refund_amount', '100'); }"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (data && data.refundId) { pm.environment.set('refund_id', data.refundId); }"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Check Refund Status",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [ { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" } ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{api_base_url}}/payments/v2/refund/{{merchant_refund_id}}/status",
              "host": ["{{api_base_url}}"],
              "path": ["payments", "v2", "refund", "{{merchant_refund_id}}", "status"]
            },
            "description": "Fetch the status of a refund by merchantRefundId."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Webhooks (Mock Server)",
      "description": "Sample PhonePe checkout callbacks. Right-click this folder -> Mock Collection to create a Postman mock server, then set mock_base_url to the generated URL and webhook_auth_sha256 to SHA256(username:password). Events: checkout.order.completed, checkout.order.failed.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Order Completed (sample)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "{{webhook_auth_sha256}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"event\": \"checkout.order.completed\",\n  \"payload\": {\n    \"merchantOrderId\": \"{{merchant_order_id}}\",\n    \"orderId\": \"{{order_id}}\",\n    \"state\": \"COMPLETED\",\n    \"amount\": 10000\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{mock_base_url}}/checkout/webhook",
              "host": ["{{mock_base_url}}"],
              "path": ["checkout", "webhook"]
            },
            "description": "Sample order-completed callback."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Order Completed",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
                  { "key": "Authorization", "value": "{{webhook_auth_sha256}}" }
                ],
                "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"event\": \"checkout.order.completed\"\n}" },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{mock_base_url}}/checkout/webhook",
                  "host": ["{{mock_base_url}}"],
                  "path": ["checkout", "webhook"]
                }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "cookie": [],
              "body": "{\n  \"event\": \"checkout.order.completed\",\n  \"payload\": {\n    \"merchantOrderId\": \"merchantOrderId\",\n    \"orderId\": \"OMO123\",\n    \"state\": \"COMPLETED\",\n    \"amount\": 10000\n  }\n}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
